menu "Atari 8-bit Bus"

config A8BB_ENABLE_MDNS
    bool "Enable mDNS hostname support"
    default n
    help
        Link mDNS support and advertise a MAC-derived hostname on the local
        network. The boot profile must also enable mDNS at runtime.

config A8BB_CORE0_HOTSPOTS_EXPLICIT_PLACEMENT
    bool "Explicitly place Core0 IRAM hotspots"
    default n
    help
        Put the Core0 hotspot functions together and align iloop_pbi to the
        next 32 KiB boundary. This guarantees separation from the Core1 loop,
        at the cost of additional IRAM address space and reduced heap space.

config A8BB_I2S_TX_DMA_ENGINE
    bool "Enable experimental I2S TX DMA engine"
    default n
    help
        Enable the highly experimental direct-buffer I2S DMA driver. It routes
        I2S DOUT to GPIO48 and must not be used with the GPIO48 profile output.
        Enabling it intentionally fails compilation until the guard in
        i2s_dma_poc.h is deliberately removed.

endmenu
